    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32232" root="غلس" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَلِيسٌ</span></b> , (Sgh, K,) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غُلَيْسٌ</span>, (JK,) a proper
name for <i>An ass;</i> [meaning <i>a wild ass;</i>] (JK,
Sgh, K;) because he is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغْلَس</span> in colour. (JK.)

